   - Changed `{"field": value}` to `{{"field": value}}`
   - This was necessary for proper str.format() substitution in the rendering framework

3. **Verified all fixes**:
   - All action specifications now pass Python compilation checks (`python3 -m py_compile`)
   - All norm check tests pass (13/13)
   - All regression tests pass (110/110)

